\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Use Case Diagram — AI NéphroCare (4 actors, 12 use cases). View Recent Activity is accessible to Professor and Resident. View Audit Log (who performed operations) is restricted to Super Admin and Head of Department.}}{38}{figure.caption.14}%
