\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces Entity-Relationship diagram — AI NéphroCare complete database schema (PostgreSQL 16). 9 custom tables. Underlined = primary key; italicised = foreign key.}}{54}{figure.caption.25}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces LLM-based automated preprocessing pipeline (Section 4.6). After file upload and profiling (Section 4.2), the Qwen2.5:14B model retrieves clinical context from ChromaDB (RAG), analyzes each row, and proposes justified corrections. After clinician review and approval by the Head of Department or Super Admin, the cleaned data enters the ML pipeline. Each integration into the database triggers an automatic AuditLog entry.}}{61}{figure.caption.32}%
